    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n26673" root="طرق" body-key="T">
    
      <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">أَطْرَقُ</span></b>  A camel <i>having the affection termed</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَرَقٌ</span>,
inf. n. of <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَرِقَ</span> [q. v.]: fem. <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَرْقَآءُ</span>: (S, O, K:)
and the latter is said by Lth to be applied to the
hind leg as meaning <i>having the crookedness termed</i>
<span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">طَرَقٌ</span> <i>in its</i> <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">سَاق</span>. (O.)

